  "description": "*\"It seems I must kill you, Your Grace.\"*\n\nInas has always been Duke Nigel Montestein's most faithful knight. But when Nigel is betrayed and killed by Inas, he wakes up a year before his supposed death. Nigel's quick to realize this isn't a mere case of time travel however, and the only one who has answers is the man who betrayed him! \n\n(Source: Manta)",
